  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Grill veggies: Preheat the grill to high. Line an oven tray with foil. Put the mushroom meat and mixed vegetables on the lined tray, scatter with half the Tuscan seasoning, drizzle with 1 tbs olive oil and toss to coat. Grill for 7-8 mins until the mushroom meat is crisp and the veggies are slightly charred.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/1231888/photos/large/220243_1-54f87babc622ba41b80c0531c199fc86.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make bean mash: Meanwhile, drain and rinse the beans. Put the beans, remaining Tuscan seasoning, 1 tbs olive oil, 1 tsp white wine vinegar and 2 tbs water in a deep bowl. Blend the bean mixture with a stick blender until smooth. (If you don't have a stick blender, mash with a potato masher until smooth.)",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/1231890/photos/large/220243_2-642112ad259aba0ce957bd9066e0f95c.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Microwave tortillas: Put the tortillas on a plate, slightly overlapping, and microwave for 30 secs or until warmed through. Coarsely tear into large pieces.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/1231892/photos/large/220243_3-0e24845f9349053af324b97d05d56c44.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve up: Divide the bean mash, mushroom meat and grilled veggies among plates. Scatter over the shredded vegan parmesan, serve with the tortillas and enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/1231894/photos/large/220243_4-f2f2d905525a97d704fa303604d934f8.jpeg"
    },
    {
